1
00:00:00,410 --> 00:00:01,740
(All people, incidents,
and backgrounds...)

2
00:00:01,810 --> 00:00:03,040
(in this drama are fictitious
and unrelated to reality.)

3
00:00:03,110 --> 00:00:04,940
(Also, children were filmed
under production guidelines.)

4
00:00:06,510 --> 00:00:07,810
(Episode 62)

5
00:00:24,930 --> 00:00:25,930
Ko Eun Seol.

6
00:00:31,570 --> 00:00:32,640
She's that girl.

7
00:00:33,270 --> 00:00:34,270
The one you were swapped with.

8
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:36,740
Ko Eun Seol.

9
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:39,040
Cheongma's hidden daughter.

10
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:42,550
(Chairman Kim Jung Sun)

11
00:00:42,780 --> 00:00:45,320
I don't know what this is about,
but let's talk later.

12
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:46,890
I'm in a bit of a rush.

13
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:01,330
What's up, guys?

14
00:01:01,500 --> 00:01:03,370
You can tell where I am
just by looking, right?

15
00:01:03,570 --> 00:01:04,740
I'm right outside...

16
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:08,410
the power-tripping actress
Kim Jung Sun's house.

17
00:01:08,770 --> 00:01:11,910
Right now,
she's holed up inside her house.

18
00:01:12,110 --> 00:01:14,510
Look at all these people outside.

19
00:01:14,680 --> 00:01:15,750
Anyway,

20
00:01:15,950 --> 00:01:19,950
even though
it's well past time for work,

21
00:01:19,980 --> 00:01:21,850
she hasn't shown her face.

22
00:01:22,190 --> 00:01:25,120
She's probably just a figurehead
who doesn't actually do anything.

23
00:01:26,930 --> 00:01:29,790
Power-tripping actress, step down.

24
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:32,030
Step down!

25
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:35,800
Chairman Kim Jung Sun,
explain yourself.

26
00:01:36,030 --> 00:01:37,670
- Explain yourself.
- Explain yourself.

27
00:01:37,740 --> 00:01:40,710
Power-tripping actress, step down.

28
00:01:40,970 --> 00:01:42,710
- Step down.
- Step down.

29
00:01:42,970 --> 00:01:46,310
- Chairman Kim Jung Sun, explain.
- Wait, the gate might open.

30
00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:47,480
Explain yourself!

31
00:01:50,750 --> 00:01:52,320
Ma'am, it's me.

32
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:53,350
Eun Seol.

33
00:01:55,390 --> 00:01:57,320
Step down!

34
00:01:57,660 --> 00:01:59,320
- Step down.
- Step down.

35
00:01:59,420 --> 00:02:01,330
- Chairman Kim Jung Sun.
- The gate's open.

36
00:02:01,330 --> 00:02:02,730
Step down!

37
00:02:03,860 --> 00:02:05,360
Gosh, Eun Seol.

38
00:02:05,660 --> 00:02:08,000
Thank you for being here.

39
00:02:08,430 --> 00:02:10,030
Ma'am, are you all right?

40
00:02:10,030 --> 00:02:11,400
Yes, I'm fine.

41
00:02:12,040 --> 00:02:14,410
Of all days, my husband
had a breakfast meeting,

42
00:02:14,470 --> 00:02:17,380
Director Joo took off
for a scholarship foundation meeting,

43
00:02:17,380 --> 00:02:19,540
and Hae Ra went to work early.

44
00:02:20,550 --> 00:02:22,010
It's a good thing I called you.

45
00:02:22,880 --> 00:02:24,920
How am I supposed
to get out, though?

46
00:02:25,380 --> 00:02:28,050
The reporters will swarm me
the second I step out.

47
00:02:29,390 --> 00:02:30,820
I have a plan.

48
00:02:31,760 --> 00:02:32,760
What?

49
00:02:34,690 --> 00:02:35,760
Oh my goodness.

50
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:42,470
Seeing you feels just like
looking at my younger self.

51
00:02:43,330 --> 00:02:44,340
Does it look good on me?

52
00:02:45,040 --> 00:02:47,770
You look beautiful,
much more than I ever did.

53
00:02:48,170 --> 00:02:50,510
Then I'll head to the intersection
we agreed on.

54
00:02:50,980 --> 00:02:53,340
All right, I'll wait for you there.

55
00:02:54,210 --> 00:02:55,480
Eun Seol, wait.

56
00:02:58,220 --> 00:02:59,780
Be careful, okay?

57
00:03:00,220 --> 00:03:01,720
Don't worry too much.

58
00:03:08,530 --> 00:03:09,830
No official statement
has been issued yet.

59
00:03:10,860 --> 00:03:13,160
- She's out.
- Here we go.

60
00:03:13,160 --> 00:03:15,130
- There she is.
- She's out. Chairman Kim.

61
00:03:15,130 --> 00:03:17,270
Is it true that your ex-manager
suffered verbal abuse...

62
00:03:17,270 --> 00:03:19,300
and was forced to run
personal errands?

63
00:03:19,370 --> 00:03:21,270
Have you managed to get in touch
with your former manager?

64
00:03:21,410 --> 00:03:23,270
Are you planning to address this
in person?

65
00:03:23,340 --> 00:03:25,580
Aren't you just a figurehead
at this point,

66
00:03:25,740 --> 00:03:27,680
rather than
a real foundation chairman?

67
00:03:30,080 --> 00:03:32,020
Is this that celebrity privilege
everyone talks about?

68
00:03:32,020 --> 00:03:33,020
Chairman.

69
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:35,320
- No word after keeping us waiting?
- Give us a comment.

70
00:03:35,390 --> 00:03:36,390
All we need is a word.

71
00:03:36,450 --> 00:03:38,190
- Any comments?
- Please answer us.

72
00:03:38,260 --> 00:03:39,260
Hey, wait.

73
00:03:39,320 --> 00:03:41,660
- Hold on.
- Give us a statement.

74
00:03:41,730 --> 00:03:43,090
(Kim Jung Sun must apologize.)

75
00:03:43,160 --> 00:03:44,860
Explain yourself!

76
00:03:49,470 --> 00:03:52,200
(Head of Design Team, Kang Hae Ra)

77
00:03:57,440 --> 00:03:59,710
(Missed Call: Mom)

78
00:04:07,790 --> 00:04:12,020
Hae Ra, don't worry too much.
I'm going to Eun Seol's place.

79
00:04:12,490 --> 00:04:15,130
Reporters won't be able
to follow me there.

80
00:04:15,690 --> 00:04:17,300
I'll be in touch.

81
00:04:19,660 --> 00:04:22,170
Why Ko Eun Seol's house
of all places?

82
00:04:22,400 --> 00:04:24,300
Why did she have to go there?

83
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:54,830
I was switched with Ko Eun Seol?

84
00:04:55,900 --> 00:05:00,200
Ko Eun Seol is Mom and Dad's
real daughter?

85
00:05:01,070 --> 00:05:02,140
Then...

86
00:05:02,940 --> 00:05:04,310
the daughter of Cheongma...

87
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:06,180
is Ko Eun Seol, not me?

88
00:05:12,220 --> 00:05:13,250
No.

89
00:05:14,620 --> 00:05:16,120
That can't be.

90
00:05:31,070 --> 00:05:32,070
Why?

91
00:05:35,940 --> 00:05:39,610
Why does Ko Eun Seol
get to be born with everything?

92
00:05:45,520 --> 00:05:50,020
All of Cheongma was mine.
It was all mine.

93
00:06:05,740 --> 00:06:07,470
No, it's not true!

94
00:06:08,010 --> 00:06:09,240
Darn it.

95
00:06:11,110 --> 00:06:12,510
(Cheongma Scholarship Foundation,
Chairman Kim Jung Sun)

96
00:06:29,660 --> 00:06:31,630
I won't let Ko Eun Seol
take this from me.

97
00:06:32,500 --> 00:06:34,600
Mom, Dad, and Cheongma.

98
00:06:35,300 --> 00:06:36,470
They're all mine.

99
00:06:40,370 --> 00:06:41,770
What's up, guys?

100
00:06:41,940 --> 00:06:43,740
You can tell where I am
just by looking, right?

101
00:06:43,910 --> 00:06:45,740
I'm right outside...

102
00:06:45,740 --> 00:06:47,280
Here's the list
of scholarship candidates...

103
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:48,450
for next quarter.

104
00:06:48,510 --> 00:06:52,120
We prioritized young people
from underprivileged backgrounds.

105
00:06:52,520 --> 00:06:54,350
- Right, leave it there.
- I'm outside the residence...

106
00:06:54,390 --> 00:06:56,490
of actress Kim Jung Sun,
who's facing allegations...

107
00:06:56,550 --> 00:06:59,220
of verbal abuse
and forced personal errands.

108
00:06:59,460 --> 00:07:03,830
Right now, Ms. Kim is believed to be
inside the house.

109
00:07:03,830 --> 00:07:06,000
Even well past the morning rush,

110
00:07:06,100 --> 00:07:09,830
she hasn't stepped outside
and remains completely silent.

111
00:07:10,940 --> 00:07:15,770
Did Ko Eun Seol
happen to ask anything about me?

112
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:19,980
Do you know
Reporter Do Ji Hoon, then?

113
00:07:22,210 --> 00:07:23,920
No, she didn't.

114
00:07:24,450 --> 00:07:26,320
Okay, fine. You may go.

115
00:07:37,260 --> 00:07:38,260
Wait.

116
00:07:39,730 --> 00:07:41,170
Ko Eun Seol...

117
00:07:41,170 --> 00:07:43,770
hasn't been answering my calls
for a while now.

118
00:07:55,710 --> 00:07:58,520
The person you are trying to reach
is unavailable.

119
00:07:58,620 --> 00:08:00,120
Please leave a message...

120
00:08:03,960 --> 00:08:06,390
Where's this brat,
and what's she doing?

121
00:08:07,530 --> 00:08:09,730
As reported, Ms. Kim Jung Sun...

122
00:08:09,830 --> 00:08:12,260
is presumed to be staying
inside her residence, but...

123
00:08:13,030 --> 00:08:15,430
You should've been more careful.

124
00:08:15,500 --> 00:08:16,800
What's notable is that
this controversy...

125
00:08:16,870 --> 00:08:18,870
goes beyond
a celebrity's personal misconduct.

126
00:08:19,140 --> 00:08:20,670
It also involves her public role...

127
00:08:20,740 --> 00:08:22,310
as head of
the Cheongma Scholarship Foundation.

128
00:08:22,570 --> 00:08:25,780
As your husband, I'd love to help.

129
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:31,120
But this is a good opportunity
for you to learn your place.

130
00:08:31,320 --> 00:08:33,020
Further revelations
can't be ruled out...

131
00:08:34,420 --> 00:08:35,420
(Oh Tae Seop)

132
00:08:37,920 --> 00:08:38,920
Hey.

133
00:08:39,990 --> 00:08:42,360
While we have the chance,

134
00:08:42,430 --> 00:08:44,200
let's handle the big stuff first.

135
00:08:45,300 --> 00:08:46,300
Right.

136
00:08:47,400 --> 00:08:51,170
Because of this, the stock price
will continue to fall for a while.

137
00:08:51,400 --> 00:08:55,140
So, let's sweep it all up
through nominee accounts.

138
00:08:57,110 --> 00:08:58,180
Right.

139
00:08:58,280 --> 00:09:01,880
I was already strapped for cash
trying to cover the leaking funds,

140
00:09:02,280 --> 00:09:05,720
so I should thank my wife
for causing such a massive mess.

141
00:09:09,020 --> 00:09:10,350
Tell me about it.

142
00:09:11,290 --> 00:09:13,390
Anyway, wrap things up nicely.

143
00:09:14,160 --> 00:09:15,660
Sure. Keep in touch.

144
00:09:23,730 --> 00:09:25,840
I somehow ended up at the factory.

145
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:29,410
That's where I saw Hae Ra's dad.

146
00:09:29,470 --> 00:09:31,480
By the offices.
Near Young Hoon's office.

147
00:09:31,540 --> 00:09:34,750
His office was just around
the corner from where we worked.

148
00:09:36,350 --> 00:09:38,880
There’s definitely
something being hidden.

149
00:09:41,250 --> 00:09:42,250
Come in.

150
00:09:47,190 --> 00:09:49,460
The CEO asked me
to deliver this to you.

151
00:09:49,990 --> 00:09:51,000
Thanks.

152
00:09:58,540 --> 00:09:59,570
Let's see.

153
00:10:02,070 --> 00:10:03,340
Oh Tae Seop.

154
00:10:04,310 --> 00:10:06,180
Oh Tae Seop?

155
00:10:07,510 --> 00:10:09,310
Why does that name sound familiar?

156
00:10:10,850 --> 00:10:12,020
Yes, come in.

157
00:10:21,430 --> 00:10:23,060
Right. Thanks.

158
00:10:23,830 --> 00:10:25,860
Did you deliver the documents?

159
00:10:25,860 --> 00:10:27,900
Yes, I gave them to Chief Cha.

160
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:30,100
Right, good work.

161
00:10:30,940 --> 00:10:32,200
Wait.

162
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:36,440
The guest list you gave Chief Cha
for the golf outing.

163
00:10:36,710 --> 00:10:38,240
Let me see that again.

164
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:40,480
Here it is, sir.

165
00:10:40,980 --> 00:10:41,980
Right.

166
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:47,050
(Kang Young Hoon, Cha Seok Jin,
Oh Tae Seop...)

167
00:10:48,650 --> 00:10:52,820
I should've taken Oh Tae Seop
off the list.

168
00:10:58,730 --> 00:11:00,300
Ma'am, right this way.

169
00:11:09,610 --> 00:11:10,710
Wait...

170
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:13,610
Isn't she actress Kim Jung Sun?

171
00:11:15,150 --> 00:11:16,810
Dad, say hello.

172
00:11:16,880 --> 00:11:18,520
She's the Chairman
of our foundation.

173
00:11:19,620 --> 00:11:22,050
Goodness, what brings you
to our humble home?

174
00:11:22,650 --> 00:11:27,290
Hello.
I'm Eun Seol's boss, Kim Jung Sun.

175
00:11:27,390 --> 00:11:29,390
Come in, right this way.

176
00:11:30,960 --> 00:11:31,960
Thank you.

177
00:11:32,030 --> 00:11:35,230
But what brings you
all the way here?

178
00:11:35,330 --> 00:11:36,330
Well...

179
00:11:36,400 --> 00:11:39,100
She's in a difficult situation,

180
00:11:39,170 --> 00:11:42,240
so she'll be staying with us
until things quiet down.

181
00:11:42,540 --> 00:11:43,840
Because of that article?

182
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:45,140
I'm afraid so.

183
00:11:47,550 --> 00:11:49,950
Well, things like this happen.

184
00:11:50,450 --> 00:11:52,820
Anyway, you can make yourself
at home here.

185
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:55,790
Treat this place like your own home
and just relax.

186
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:58,320
Thank you.

187
00:11:59,490 --> 00:12:01,560
Are you kidding me?

188
00:12:01,630 --> 00:12:03,030
What century are we living in...

189
00:12:03,090 --> 00:12:05,060
where people still pull power trips
on their subordinates?

190
00:12:05,860 --> 00:12:08,370
Top actress, my foot.

191
00:12:09,800 --> 00:12:10,970
What are you doing?

192
00:12:11,040 --> 00:12:13,470
- I can't breathe!
- It's that actress.

193
00:12:15,170 --> 00:12:16,170
Oh my gosh!

194
00:12:16,770 --> 00:12:19,980
Wait, why is she here?

195
00:12:26,020 --> 00:12:28,190
The call cannot be connected.
Please leave a message...

196
00:12:28,250 --> 00:12:30,120
Still no word from my wife?

197
00:12:31,560 --> 00:12:34,130
No, she's not answering her phone.

198
00:12:34,190 --> 00:12:35,860
Good grief.

199
00:12:39,400 --> 00:12:43,370
Don't worry, honey.
I'm somewhere safe.

200
00:12:44,030 --> 00:12:46,970
I'll call you
once I get my thoughts together.

201
00:12:49,110 --> 00:12:52,780
Sounds like my wife is planning
to rest up at the villa.

202
00:12:53,980 --> 00:12:55,610
That might be for the best.

203
00:12:55,850 --> 00:12:58,280
Staying here would just be
way too noisy and chaotic anyway.

204
00:12:58,550 --> 00:13:00,250
Getting some fresh air...

205
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:02,350
and resting for a few days
might do her good.

206
00:13:02,620 --> 00:13:03,650
I agree.

207
00:13:04,190 --> 00:13:06,790
She has been having
a hard time lately.

208
00:13:08,890 --> 00:13:09,930
Director Joo.

209
00:13:11,460 --> 00:13:13,900
Care for a glass of whiskey tonight?

210
00:13:15,500 --> 00:13:16,500
I'd love that.

211
00:13:21,510 --> 00:13:22,510
Mom.

212
00:13:23,510 --> 00:13:24,510
Yes?

213
00:13:25,110 --> 00:13:26,640
I wanted to ask you something.

214
00:13:28,450 --> 00:13:30,710
Do you happen to know
a man named Oh Tae Seop?

215
00:13:31,320 --> 00:13:32,350
Tae Seop...

216
00:13:32,820 --> 00:13:34,450
Oh Tae Seop.

217
00:13:35,950 --> 00:13:38,060
He is a bad man.

218
00:13:39,360 --> 00:13:40,420
A bad man?

219
00:13:40,890 --> 00:13:42,390
Yes, he's bad.

220
00:13:43,390 --> 00:13:45,660
He hurt my darling.

221
00:13:47,100 --> 00:13:50,270
How was he bad? Why did he hurt Dad?

222
00:13:50,570 --> 00:13:52,240
My darling...

223
00:13:54,510 --> 00:13:57,110
He slammed into my darling
with a truck.

224
00:14:01,910 --> 00:14:04,150
I don't want to draw anymore.

225
00:14:05,150 --> 00:14:07,790
Mr. Seok Jin, please don't talk
about that man.

226
00:14:07,990 --> 00:14:10,720
All right, I'll stop, Mom.
I'm sorry.

227
00:14:16,490 --> 00:14:17,530
Really?

228
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:20,800
The actress Kim Jung Sun is staying
at your place?

229
00:14:21,500 --> 00:14:22,530
Yes.

230
00:14:22,770 --> 00:14:25,640
Sounds like something happened,
but I didn't ask for details.

231
00:14:26,470 --> 00:14:28,970
It's probably because
of that news report.

232
00:14:29,040 --> 00:14:31,710
You know, right?
My only interest in the world...

233
00:14:32,610 --> 00:14:33,710
is you, Mi Rae.

234
00:14:33,710 --> 00:14:35,010
Whatever.

235
00:14:36,010 --> 00:14:38,180
So how's she handling meals?

236
00:14:38,880 --> 00:14:41,350
Eun Seol must be in a tough spot.

237
00:14:41,850 --> 00:14:43,720
Had I known, I would've helped out.

238
00:14:43,820 --> 00:14:46,060
Well, Dad said he'd cook,

239
00:14:46,790 --> 00:14:48,390
and Eun Seol will probably help him.

240
00:14:51,630 --> 00:14:52,800
What should we eat?

241
00:14:53,630 --> 00:14:55,500
Until your grandma
gives her permission,

242
00:14:55,700 --> 00:14:56,930
keep your distance.

243
00:14:57,200 --> 00:14:58,840
Come on, really?

244
00:15:04,640 --> 00:15:05,640
Well...

245
00:15:05,910 --> 00:15:07,650
It's not much, but please dig in.

246
00:15:08,110 --> 00:15:12,680
Oh, right. Eun Seol
made these pancakes herself.

247
00:15:12,920 --> 00:15:14,250
I see.

248
00:15:15,890 --> 00:15:17,250
Thank you for the food.

249
00:15:18,190 --> 00:15:19,320
Please go ahead.

250
00:15:20,020 --> 00:15:21,030
Right.

251
00:15:24,900 --> 00:15:27,830
By the way, when are you leaving?

252
00:15:28,370 --> 00:15:29,370
Excuse me?

253
00:15:29,370 --> 00:15:32,900
Not that I'm uncomfortable
with you being here,

254
00:15:33,540 --> 00:15:35,040
but it's not like...

255
00:15:35,240 --> 00:15:37,340
you're planning to settle down here
for good.

256
00:15:37,510 --> 00:15:39,880
She'll leave
once the reporters back off...

257
00:15:40,180 --> 00:15:42,250
and we wrap things up.

258
00:15:44,880 --> 00:15:47,820
Thank you for taking me in
like this.

259
00:15:47,920 --> 00:15:49,120
Not at all.

260
00:15:49,350 --> 00:15:52,190
You're Eun Seol's boss,
so of course we should help.

261
00:15:53,090 --> 00:15:54,990
And...

262
00:15:55,530 --> 00:15:58,260
if I may say so, I'm actually...

263
00:15:58,960 --> 00:16:00,000
a big fan.

264
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:04,370
That drama you starred in,
"Blue Season."

265
00:16:04,440 --> 00:16:06,340
I never missed an episode.

266
00:16:06,340 --> 00:16:08,240
Having you enjoy my cooking...

267
00:16:08,310 --> 00:16:10,240
is truly an honor for our family.

268
00:16:10,310 --> 00:16:11,880
Honor, my foot.

269
00:16:14,180 --> 00:16:15,280
Ma'am,

270
00:16:16,050 --> 00:16:17,450
please try some of this.

271
00:16:17,720 --> 00:16:19,120
Right. Thank you.

272
00:16:36,770 --> 00:16:37,900
Ko Eun Seol.

273
00:16:43,740 --> 00:16:46,710
You've always gotten
in the way of my life.

274
00:16:51,750 --> 00:16:53,780
Why did we get entangled like this?

275
00:17:00,460 --> 00:17:01,460
No.

276
00:17:03,560 --> 00:17:04,830
Maybe...

277
00:17:08,030 --> 00:17:10,500
it was our destiny from the start.

278
00:18:11,660 --> 00:18:14,630
I found out I was adopted
when I was in high school.

279
00:18:16,170 --> 00:18:19,140
Before that, I had no idea.

280
00:18:20,140 --> 00:18:22,340
They cherished me
just as much as my brother.

281
00:18:23,040 --> 00:18:24,170
I see.

282
00:18:26,080 --> 00:18:29,380
It must've been tough
for you too, Eun Seol.

283
00:18:32,620 --> 00:18:33,980
From what I saw earlier,

284
00:18:34,450 --> 00:18:37,890
your grandmother can be a bit harsh
with her words.

285
00:18:39,620 --> 00:18:42,730
That's just how she is.

286
00:18:43,690 --> 00:18:47,260
She seems rough on the outside,
but she has a very tender heart.

287
00:18:51,270 --> 00:18:52,770
By the way, Eun Seol,

288
00:18:53,400 --> 00:18:54,870
do you...

289
00:18:55,710 --> 00:18:57,710
believe those articles about me?

290
00:18:58,840 --> 00:19:00,340
Of course not.

291
00:19:01,110 --> 00:19:03,550
This is you we're talking about.

292
00:19:04,680 --> 00:19:05,680
Besides,

293
00:19:06,280 --> 00:19:08,250
the person truly at fault...

294
00:19:09,020 --> 00:19:10,320
is someone else entirely.

295
00:19:11,490 --> 00:19:12,920
I'm still really glad to hear that.

296
00:19:13,160 --> 00:19:15,460
It means a lot
that you believe in me like this.

297
00:19:17,230 --> 00:19:19,200
Thank you, Eun Seol.

298
00:20:21,630 --> 00:20:23,860
It's a daring design,

299
00:20:24,460 --> 00:20:27,260
but even middle-aged couples
often buy matching sets these days.

300
00:20:27,260 --> 00:20:30,930
Just a few days ago, a gentleman
picked up a matching set too.

301
00:20:31,840 --> 00:20:33,400
What's up, guys?

302
00:20:33,470 --> 00:20:35,370
You can tell where I am
just by looking, right?

303
00:20:35,470 --> 00:20:36,740
I'm right outside...

304
00:20:36,840 --> 00:20:39,940
the power-tripping actress
Kim Jung Sun's house.

305
00:20:55,330 --> 00:20:56,760
I'll head out first.

306
00:20:57,230 --> 00:20:58,830
Aren't you going to eat more?

307
00:20:59,160 --> 00:21:00,660
My stomach is churning too much.

308
00:21:00,930 --> 00:21:04,500
You should've taken it easy
on the drinking.

309
00:21:13,440 --> 00:21:15,210
Have you seen the comments
on Chairman Kim's article?

310
00:21:15,650 --> 00:21:18,050
Aren't people being way too harsh?

311
00:21:18,080 --> 00:21:19,120
Tell me about it.

312
00:21:19,220 --> 00:21:20,750
They didn't even bother
hearing both sides.

313
00:21:28,360 --> 00:21:32,430
Ms. Kang, is the Chairman okay?

314
00:21:32,460 --> 00:21:33,500
What?

315
00:21:34,330 --> 00:21:36,170
Yes, she's fine.

316
00:21:36,630 --> 00:21:38,040
She's taking some time off
for a bit.

317
00:21:38,370 --> 00:21:39,870
I see.

318
00:21:44,310 --> 00:21:45,640
(Hae Ra, don't worry too much.
I'm going to Eun Seol's place.)

319
00:21:45,640 --> 00:21:46,940
(Reporters won't be able
to follow me there.)

320
00:22:16,240 --> 00:22:17,610
Were you behind this?

321
00:22:17,770 --> 00:22:20,180
Why? Is there a problem?

322
00:22:20,740 --> 00:22:22,150
Why are you taking it this far?

323
00:22:22,210 --> 00:22:23,910
Did you really have to
ruin everything like this?

324
00:22:32,590 --> 00:22:34,320
Who do you think this is all for?

325
00:22:35,460 --> 00:22:37,760
Do you see now
how hard I've been working...

326
00:22:38,300 --> 00:22:40,900
just to put you
at the top of Cheongma?

327
00:22:43,230 --> 00:22:44,770
Listen carefully, Kang Hae Ra.

328
00:22:45,700 --> 00:22:46,740
You're neither...

329
00:22:47,100 --> 00:22:49,710
Kim Jung Sun's daughter
nor Kang Young Hoon's.

330
00:22:50,640 --> 00:22:52,480
For Cheongma to be yours,

331
00:22:52,680 --> 00:22:54,710
you need to wipe
those two out completely.

332
00:22:56,250 --> 00:22:58,050
I'm willing to do that for you.

333
00:22:59,220 --> 00:23:01,520
Even if it means
getting my hands dirty.

334
00:23:10,860 --> 00:23:13,260
(Planning Director, Cha Seok Jin)

335
00:23:16,830 --> 00:23:17,830
Tae Seop...

336
00:23:18,840 --> 00:23:20,070
Oh Tae Seop.

337
00:23:21,440 --> 00:23:23,610
He is a bad man.

338
00:23:24,910 --> 00:23:27,380
- A bad man?
- My darling...

339
00:23:29,750 --> 00:23:32,380
He slammed into my darling
with a truck.

340
00:23:41,860 --> 00:23:43,830
(Oh Tae Seop:
Logistics and Distribution HQ)

341
00:24:19,830 --> 00:24:21,700
Goodness, Chief Cha.

342
00:24:22,500 --> 00:24:24,270
What brings you here?

343
00:24:25,600 --> 00:24:28,370
I came to see you
because I have a favor to ask.

344
00:24:29,170 --> 00:24:32,040
What kind of favor brings
such a busy man all the way here?

345
00:24:33,380 --> 00:24:36,250
I want to score some points
with CEO Kang, you see.

346
00:24:37,350 --> 00:24:39,680
I heard the two of you
are especially close.

347
00:24:39,980 --> 00:24:41,620
With your help,

348
00:24:41,620 --> 00:24:44,920
I was hoping to score some points
with him at this upcoming golf game.

349
00:24:45,120 --> 00:24:46,160
Would that be all right?

350
00:24:46,460 --> 00:24:48,120
Oh, sure.

351
00:24:49,260 --> 00:24:52,300
For you, Chief Cha,
I'd be more than happy to help.

352
00:24:57,770 --> 00:25:00,540
Eun Seol,
were you very busy yesterday?

353
00:25:00,870 --> 00:25:03,510
You took off early
and wouldn't answer your phone.

354
00:25:03,610 --> 00:25:06,840
I wasn't feeling too well,
so I headed home early.

355
00:25:07,610 --> 00:25:09,610
I fell right asleep
without realizing you called.

356
00:25:09,750 --> 00:25:10,880
I see.

357
00:25:10,950 --> 00:25:12,820
You shouldn't work yourself so hard.

358
00:25:13,920 --> 00:25:16,050
There's nothing going on, right?

359
00:25:16,450 --> 00:25:20,090
Of course not. If anything comes up,
you'll be the first to know.

360
00:25:20,490 --> 00:25:22,190
You're my mom, after all.

361
00:25:23,660 --> 00:25:25,200
You're right.

362
00:25:26,260 --> 00:25:27,930
Okay, here you go.

363
00:25:29,200 --> 00:25:32,340
Eun Seol, want to go shopping
with me today?

364
00:25:32,770 --> 00:25:35,370
I'm sorry,
I'm not feeling great today,

365
00:25:35,440 --> 00:25:36,610
so I just want to rest.

366
00:25:38,140 --> 00:25:39,780
Well, it can't be helped.

367
00:25:40,240 --> 00:25:41,710
Let's go together next time, Mom.

368
00:25:42,310 --> 00:25:44,580
We have plenty of time ahead of us.

369
00:25:44,920 --> 00:25:46,520
Tons of it.

370
00:25:47,550 --> 00:25:48,650
Sure, let's do that.

371
00:26:02,000 --> 00:26:04,770
That girl is impossible to read.

372
00:26:05,740 --> 00:26:07,400
I saw the article
about the Chairman.

373
00:26:08,040 --> 00:26:11,610
It looked like
Reporter Do Ji Hoon wrote it.

374
00:26:13,710 --> 00:26:14,710
Eun Seol.

375
00:26:16,080 --> 00:26:18,520
Did you already know
Director Joo was behind this...

376
00:26:19,720 --> 00:26:21,320
when you asked me?

377
00:26:21,690 --> 00:26:23,790
She seemed the most suspicious.

378
00:26:24,960 --> 00:26:28,360
Now that we know for certain
it was her doing,

379
00:26:28,960 --> 00:26:30,060
do you think...

380
00:26:30,590 --> 00:26:33,460
you could help me out a little more?

381
00:26:47,380 --> 00:26:48,510
I looked into it,

382
00:26:48,950 --> 00:26:50,110
and just like you said,

383
00:26:50,210 --> 00:26:51,210
he's super shady.

384
00:26:51,350 --> 00:26:53,650
(Rising Actor S Accused
of Past School Bullying)

385
00:26:53,720 --> 00:26:54,880
(Bribery Log: Reporter Do Ji Hoon)

386
00:26:57,020 --> 00:26:58,050
Wait.

387
00:26:58,820 --> 00:27:01,020
Is it okay for you to show me this?

388
00:27:01,890 --> 00:27:03,760
Secretary Choi,
aren't you loyal to Director Joo?

389
00:27:04,260 --> 00:27:06,300
I'm on your side too, Eun Seol.

390
00:27:08,000 --> 00:27:09,970
You're loyal to me too?

391
00:27:11,870 --> 00:27:12,870
Yes.

392
00:27:13,700 --> 00:27:14,900
I have a reason...

393
00:27:15,940 --> 00:27:16,940
to help you.

394
00:27:18,410 --> 00:27:19,410
And what reason is that?

395
00:27:21,210 --> 00:27:23,950
Not right now.

396
00:27:24,950 --> 00:27:26,020
Later.

397
00:27:26,820 --> 00:27:27,880
I'll explain it all later.

398
00:27:29,390 --> 00:27:31,920
Only suspicious people
say things like that.

399
00:27:33,760 --> 00:27:36,990
Just like you opened up to me
about how you feel,

400
00:27:39,900 --> 00:27:41,160
I'm being sincere too.

401
00:27:43,030 --> 00:27:44,030
I really am on your side.

402
00:27:48,170 --> 00:27:49,170
Secretary Choi,

403
00:27:50,240 --> 00:27:52,410
don't trust Director Joo too much.

404
00:27:54,240 --> 00:27:55,910
You might end up regretting it.

405
00:28:01,250 --> 00:28:02,720
I have an appointment,

406
00:28:03,520 --> 00:28:04,720
so I'd better head out.

407
00:28:04,990 --> 00:28:07,290
All right. See you tomorrow.

408
00:28:16,870 --> 00:28:18,100
As for regretting it,

409
00:28:20,400 --> 00:28:23,510
I've already come too far, Eun Seol.

410
00:28:34,650 --> 00:28:37,390
What? Chief Cha came to see you?

411
00:28:38,150 --> 00:28:39,490
He didn't say much when he came by.

412
00:28:40,020 --> 00:28:41,890
He only asked about our golf club.

413
00:28:42,660 --> 00:28:44,330
He said he wanted to win you over,

414
00:28:45,130 --> 00:28:46,900
so I told him
he could ask me anything.

415
00:28:48,100 --> 00:28:49,600
Did he say anything else?

416
00:28:50,330 --> 00:28:51,670
No, he didn't.

417
00:28:52,700 --> 00:28:53,700
All right, got it.

418
00:28:54,540 --> 00:28:56,240
I'll look into it and contact you,

419
00:28:56,910 --> 00:28:59,710
so steer clear of the group for now.

420
00:29:00,140 --> 00:29:01,180
Yes, will do.

421
00:29:06,420 --> 00:29:08,080
Did Cha Seok Jin...

422
00:29:09,090 --> 00:29:10,590
figure something out?

423
00:29:13,420 --> 00:29:15,990
No. There's no way.

424
00:29:25,270 --> 00:29:27,170
Wait. What's this?

425
00:29:28,040 --> 00:29:30,310
Everyone needs to watch
their blood sugar these days.

426
00:29:30,670 --> 00:29:31,880
So I got this for you.

427
00:29:32,110 --> 00:29:33,540
Goodness, Eun Seol.

428
00:29:33,740 --> 00:29:36,410
This is that product
everyone is talking about.

429
00:29:36,950 --> 00:29:38,050
Right.

430
00:29:38,280 --> 00:29:41,420
Thank you all so much for welcoming
the Chairman into our home.

431
00:29:41,520 --> 00:29:43,550
It's an honor to have someone like her
visit our home,

432
00:29:43,590 --> 00:29:44,820
so of course we should.

433
00:29:45,220 --> 00:29:46,790
- Thank you.
- You're welcome.

434
00:29:47,320 --> 00:29:49,130
So,

435
00:29:49,430 --> 00:29:51,660
how do you take this?

436
00:29:51,660 --> 00:29:52,700
Just take one pill at a time,

437
00:29:52,800 --> 00:29:54,100
three times a day.

438
00:29:56,170 --> 00:29:58,230
That's so convenient.

439
00:29:58,430 --> 00:29:59,540
- Just one pill?
- Yes.

440
00:29:59,740 --> 00:30:00,770
Then this...

441
00:30:02,140 --> 00:30:04,170
Here. You first.

442
00:30:04,410 --> 00:30:07,610
No, your mother
should definitely take one first.

443
00:30:07,780 --> 00:30:09,950
You're our guest, and as a fan...

444
00:30:11,350 --> 00:30:12,580
Have you no respect for your elders?

445
00:30:16,190 --> 00:30:18,020
It has a subtle pine scent.

446
00:30:19,490 --> 00:30:20,520
That's right.

447
00:30:20,860 --> 00:30:24,360
Actually, it's a product
I take at home, too.

448
00:30:24,790 --> 00:30:27,000
The scent is so soothing.

449
00:30:27,630 --> 00:30:29,000
Thanks to Eun Seol,

450
00:30:29,200 --> 00:30:32,900
this will help the whole family
look after their everyday health.

451
00:30:35,610 --> 00:30:38,310
- You should try one too.
- Pardon?

452
00:30:38,980 --> 00:30:39,980
Here.

453
00:30:39,980 --> 00:30:42,150
You're handing me one? I'm honored.

454
00:30:42,150 --> 00:30:43,780
- Go ahead.
- Thanks.

455
00:30:44,610 --> 00:30:45,620
Thank you.

456
00:30:50,490 --> 00:30:51,490
No way.

457
00:30:52,090 --> 00:30:53,690
- I mean...
- You smell the pine, right?

458
00:30:53,760 --> 00:30:56,460
It smells refreshing. Yes, it does.

459
00:30:56,590 --> 00:30:58,430
Wait, we can't be
the only ones taking it.

460
00:30:58,490 --> 00:30:59,830
Eun Seol, take one too.

461
00:31:00,030 --> 00:31:03,530
You have to take care of your health
while you're still young.

462
00:31:04,130 --> 00:31:05,670
Okay. Thanks, Dad.

463
00:31:11,510 --> 00:31:13,140
I'll be imposing on you for a while.

464
00:31:14,380 --> 00:31:16,750
Impose on us for life.
It's our honor.

465
00:31:16,810 --> 00:31:18,280
Honor, my foot.

466
00:31:18,850 --> 00:31:20,680
Do you want another one?

467
00:31:20,750 --> 00:31:22,950
- Have as many as you like.
- Ma'am, can we speak in my room?

468
00:31:23,520 --> 00:31:24,520
Sure.

469
00:31:26,690 --> 00:31:28,960
I'll take good care of this.

470
00:31:29,030 --> 00:31:30,260
- Yes, of course.
- Right.

471
00:31:34,500 --> 00:31:36,000
Hand it over.

472
00:31:40,470 --> 00:31:41,470
So...

473
00:31:42,140 --> 00:31:43,210
you're telling me...

474
00:31:43,710 --> 00:31:45,780
Director Joo was behind
this article?

475
00:31:46,980 --> 00:31:48,340
It certainly looks that way.

476
00:31:49,450 --> 00:31:51,450
And when the scholarship program
was voted down,

477
00:31:51,510 --> 00:31:53,680
it seemed like she had already
pulled strings beforehand.

478
00:31:55,120 --> 00:31:56,150
She did that?

479
00:31:57,250 --> 00:31:58,420
It seems she swayed
the board members...

480
00:31:58,420 --> 00:31:59,820
to vote in her favor.

481
00:32:02,490 --> 00:32:03,690
That's absurd.

482
00:32:05,130 --> 00:32:06,160
How could she do this to me?

483
00:32:06,860 --> 00:32:09,300
After all the years
we've known each other?

484
00:32:10,130 --> 00:32:11,130
Ma'am.

485
00:32:13,070 --> 00:32:14,300
I'll help you.

486
00:32:32,420 --> 00:32:33,520
Do you still...

487
00:32:33,920 --> 00:32:35,460
trust Director Joo after this?

488
00:32:58,580 --> 00:32:59,580
This ends here.

489
00:33:35,720 --> 00:33:39,360
(A Trap Called Desire)

490
00:33:39,620 --> 00:33:41,360
Give me any task.
Your dad can do it all.

491
00:33:41,360 --> 00:33:43,090
I'm your father!

492
00:33:43,160 --> 00:33:45,190
Who was chosen as the acting head
of the scholarship foundation?

493
00:33:45,260 --> 00:33:46,760
Director Joo, how thoughtful of you.

494
00:33:46,830 --> 00:33:49,100
It feels as though things are
finally in their rightful place.

495
00:33:49,170 --> 00:33:51,330
By the way,
about Director Oh Tae Seop...

496
00:33:51,770 --> 00:33:54,140
There's no other way for you and me.

497
00:33:54,240 --> 00:33:56,510
You're my role model, Mom.

498
00:33:56,570 --> 00:33:58,670
Could Director Joo
really have done it?

499
00:33:58,780 --> 00:34:01,440
Why? Did something happen
with Director Joo?

500
00:34:01,580 --> 00:34:04,180
Seok Jin, how high do you
want to climb?

501
00:34:04,180 --> 00:34:05,780
How could you seduce my father?

502
00:34:05,950 --> 00:34:07,450
You didn't have to go this far.

503
00:34:07,450 --> 00:34:08,720
I'll have it all.

504
00:34:08,790 --> 00:34:10,090
Mom, Dad,

505
00:34:10,720 --> 00:34:11,790
and even Cheongma.

506
00:34:13,420 --> 00:34:15,430
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
